            {
                "entry_id": "1cc57bdd-631a-3c4b-8d5c-d20a58e0e52d",
                "word": "asher",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9c56fa4b-ef5f-4c85-a196-65b145e464d4",
                        "entry_id": "1cc57bdd-631a-3c4b-8d5c-d20a58e0e52d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ashers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "11397ae0-52bd-3ea7-ba6c-253f109032fa",
                        "entry_id": "1cc57bdd-631a-3c4b-8d5c-d20a58e0e52d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A member of the alt.suicide.holiday newsgroup, which deals with the topics of suicide and depression."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffa9fe3f-f42c-4c2e-b76d-9462adde6dcf",
                                "sense_id": "11397ae0-52bd-3ea7-ba6c-253f109032fa",
                                "text": "ANYONE who first stumbles upon ash is bound to want to SAVE these desperately unhappy people. If you think Daisy was the first or last person trying to knock sense into the ashers, you are wrong. And from my observations, Anyone with only good intentions, (say trying to give ashers a spiritual outlook) is visciously ^([sic]) attacked by ash."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be324d5e-42dc-43e5-a572-09aab07f4d4e",
                                "sense_id": "11397ae0-52bd-3ea7-ba6c-253f109032fa",
                                "text": "I can't remember how this thread started to be honest, but if someone said that suicide won't affect others, I agree with you about that. In fact I think all ASHers would agree that a suicide is not an isolated event that won't make ripples in the life of others."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3fd50e8a-f662-4a4f-8513-e123b8fecdd6",
                                "sense_id": "11397ae0-52bd-3ea7-ba6c-253f109032fa",
                                "text": "Ashers offer such good arguments. Like: \"You're dumb.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fffdee3b-22a9-4c21-a8ae-4579d03a16f3",
                                "sense_id": "11397ae0-52bd-3ea7-ba6c-253f109032fa",
                                "text": "Some ashers dislike and ridicule online forums like asd, that provide a more traditional forms ^([sic]) of support, as useless and requiring insincere displays of affection. This view is quite subjective. The support on asd suits those who read it, and not ashers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
